      RigCount >= 3, run a random range to find the odds of an attack being performed.","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"b32554b1-98d0-42c0-90ee-7a6a239a65bc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":-218.0,"yMin":415.0,"xMax":2138.0,"yMax":1385.0},"label":"Depending
      on the boss'' Phase and Attacking Instructions (ID & Range), call the proper
      attack and return to its designated state once cooldown ends!","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"aae59bf5-4375-4e2b-8590-c6ac6bb09b54","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":607.0,"yMin":-1301.0,"xMax":761.0,"yMax":-1201.0},"title":"ChargeRig","body":"If
      shot 3 times, boss is rigged to charge at close range. Else, the odds are randomized.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"250d41e2-2bdc-4431-9bb5-8b0de0b25436","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-158.0,"yMin":-927.0,"xMax":32.0,"yMax":-759.0},"title":"ATTACK
      ODDS: Long","body":"- PHASE 1 -\nN/A: 1.0f, ID = 2\r\nSlam : 0.05f, ID = 1\r\nCharge
      : 0.03f, ID= 0 \n\n- PHASE 3 -\nN/A: 1.0f, ID = 2\n1 Rock: 0.666666f, ID =
      1\n3 Rocks: 0.333333f, ID = 0\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"9b4b48ee-1c2b-4a62-acdc-6f5219fc5788","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-208.0,"yMin":1000.0,"xMax":1296.0,"yMax":1064.0},"title":"SELECTIONS","body":"If
      it''s currently Phase 3 and a Ranged Attack is called, the boss will throw
      rocks from a distance. Otherwise, it will slam or charge depending on what
      the ID matches. The cooldown timer reflects the attack animation types selected.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"d721e406-47f6-41ac-8ccc-ec2107d62d63","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":36.0,"yMin":-926.0,"xMax":236.0,"yMax":-759.0},"title":"ATTACK
      ODDS: Close","body":"Slam: 0.99f, ID = 1\r\nCharge : 0.01f, ID = 0\r\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"ddf80985-c45e-4540-9f50-fc2a38df008b","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":500.0,"yMin":-36.0,"xMax":733.0,"yMax":79.0},"title":"LRAC
      Outputs","body":"If the Attack ID is the same as the AttackOddsRange count
      (the max value of the list), the boss does nothing and loops its pursuit. This
      prevents a value over the list length of possible attacks from passing in.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"d1a0ac34-b431-410e-9ac4-363aa36cb24d","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}},"isStart":true,"position":{"x":150.0,"y":27.0},"width":170.0,"guid":"905e6348-3324-4f52-8826-57ca2cd0a095","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.FlowState"}],"$version":"A"}},"isStart":false,"position":{"x":-131.0,"y":105.0},"width":170.0,"guid":"1096db24-3724-40a2-8ca8-fa6ad469b355","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.SuperState","$id":"514"},{"nest":{"source":"Embed","macro":null,"embed":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Intro","summary":"Plays
